From 3cf1a199f8792a2b4cb5fb4b7d7aa3712fdd18c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nake Sekander <nake.sekander@strakergroup.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 11:25:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 12/13] feat(agent): confirming click for people who cannot see
 quotes; in-thread posts without a click

G1: submit_document_translation is gated, shows no price, and makes the same call
the document form's Submit makes today. Behind AGENT_NATIVE_DOCUMENT_QUOTES, off by
default. A static test pins enqueue_document_mt_submission to that one function.
G2: an explicit request in a channel thread is its own record, so
post_translation_in_thread runs without a click; anywhere else still needs one.
Fixed replies lead with the way forward. No reminders about expired quotes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
